{"folder":null,"name":"Colossus Armor (H)","type":"armor","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/5/56/Heavy-human-Colossus.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Kassa Fabrication's Colossus hardsuit is built around a triple-layer ceramic ablative shell reinforced with woven durasteel. Onboard micro-generators boost shield efficiency while the suit's distinctive red-and-black plating provides the highest raw damage protection available to a soldier in the field. Standard issue for front-line Alliance marines on the most dangerous postings.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"colossus-h","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["bulwark","tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"colossus","bulk":{"value":3},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":600}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"containerId":null,"size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unusual Armor","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/armor.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"category":"heavy","group":"plate","acBonus":6,"strength":4,"dexCap":1,"checkPenalty":-2,"speedPenalty":-5,"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"resilient":0,"property":[]},"subitems":[],"specific":null},"_id":"9f732a2b3202768c"}
